  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "A concealed figure shoots into Iron Eagle blessed land at lightning speed. Righteous path Gu Immortals name a junior from Nian Er tribe and identify sword path cultivation. Qing Xuan Zi looks up, sword light flashes, and the killer’s voice names Nian Er Ping Zhi as Qing Xuan Zi’s head falls.",
      "chapters": [
        1105
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_iron_eagle_blessed_land",
        "sys_righteous_path",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "fac_nian_er_tribe",
        "char_qing_xuan_zi"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He has sharp brows and clear eyes, a handsome young lad. In motion he is one with his sword, often only sword light, his body a blur. His voice is clear.",
      "chapters": [
        1106
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Qing Xuan Zi had rank six cultivation and had undergone a heavenly tribulation, yet dies at once. Nian Er Ping Zhi then kills a second demonic path Gu Immortal after a brief retreat. Nian Er Fu, a rank seven who looks like a fat boy, says this lad obtained the Sword Saint true inheritance and was kept in the tribe by first supreme elder for ten years, so this is his first time out. Righteous path talk names him the newest generation Sword Child: after the first portion of that inheritance, the inheritor is called Sword Child. A new Sword Child had not appeared in Nian Er tribe for three hundred years. Sword Child cultivation at rank six is already a force to be reckoned with.",
      "chapters": [
        1106
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "sword-child",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_nian_er_fu",
        "inh_sword_saint_true_inheritance",
        "sys_sword_child"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan later groups the Nian Er Sword Saint true inheritance with Hei Fan’s line: an inheritor appears only every few hundred years, and the current one is Nian Er Ping Zhi.",
      "chapters": [
        1132
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "sword-child",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "char_hei_fan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "His sword light pierces Old Monster Corpse Poison, then turns back into his body a hundred steps away.",
      "chapters": [
        1107
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "corpse-poison-duel",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_old_monster_corpse_poison"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Poisoned, one arm corroded to bone and his face purple, he still demands a victor. He is rank six, with only a portion of the Sword Saint true inheritance, and cannot match that rank seven expert. Nian Er Fu assists from a distance, saving his life and injuring Old Monster Corpse Poison in secret. Nian Er tribe’s Huang Jin tribesmen live in blessed lands or grotto-heavens and occupy no outside territory, so they fight demonic path experts with fewer reservations.",
      "chapters": [
        1108
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "corpse-poison-duel",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "When the eagle-nest scramble turns deadly, Nian Er Fu grabs the unconscious junior and retreats.",
      "chapters": [
        1109
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "corpse-poison-duel",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "The duel makes him famous overnight. At Bai Zu tribe’s banquet only two Nian Er immortals attended: Nian Er Fu and the current Sword Child, who paid a hefty price. Old Monster Corpse Poison stares at him with hatred.",
      "chapters": [
        1110
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "corpse-poison-duel",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_bai_zu_tribe"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Gong Wan Ting sends him as Nian Er tribe’s current Sword Child. He shouts for someone who wants to die. Chu Du’s side warns that rank six cultivation can still kill rank sevens, that Iron Eagle blessed land already showed savage results, and that he is the current inheritor of Sword Saint Nian Er’s true inheritance. Granny Yin, a famous rank seven demonic path expert, takes the stage. He howls, ignores Nian Er Yi Fang’s order to withdraw, and charges as sword light.",
      "chapters": [
        1195
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "blood-martial-competition",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_gong_wan_ting",
        "char_chu_du",
        "char_granny_yin",
        "char_nian_er_yi_fang"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Granny Yin’s bewitching soul art seems to land. He then cuts her in two with a fast sword light. Nian Er Yi Fang names sword heart clarity, an immortal killer move in the Sword Saint true inheritance used to restrict wisdom path and similar methods, and says few Sword Childs in history could use it. Chu Du judges the killing move to be one sword life, used by Sword Saint Nian Er in his younger days. Nian Er Ping Zhi is heavily injured, takes both halves of the corpse as spoils.",
      "chapters": [
        1196
      ],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "blood-martial-competition",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_sword_saint_nian_er"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Granny Yin’s soul is destroyed. Nian Er tribe later trades that corpse to Liu tribe.",
      "chapters": [
        1197
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "blood-martial-competition",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_liu_tribe"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The kill moves Nian Er tribe toward the center of the righteous path seating. He is still rank six, a young genius able to kill rank seven.",
      "chapters": [
        1201
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "blood-martial-competition",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "After Fang Yuan as Liu Guan Yi kills Ye Lui Qun Xing, Nian Er Yi Fang tells him to avoid that elder alone. He answers that he is only a Sword Child now, and that when he becomes a Swordmaster and cultivates to rank seven he will fight Liu Guan Yi properly.",
      "chapters": [
        1205
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "blood-martial-competition",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_ye_lui_qun_xing"
      ]
    }
  ],
